  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow nicks your ankle, causing a small but painful cut on a malleolus that only hurts more as your footwear rubs against it for every step you take!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a penalty of -1 to your M for the rest of the encounter. You may make a <strong>Challenging (+0) Cool</strong> or <strong>Endurance</strong> Test each turn to ignore the penalty, but a failure of -4 SL or more will prevent you from any more tests as you accidentally open the cut further. If you weren’t wearing any footwear or take an Action to remove it you automatically pass the Test. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
    },
